#: ../../library/grp.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!grp` --- The group database"
msgstr ":mod:`!grp` --- 群組資料庫"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:9
msgid ""
"This module provides access to the Unix group database. It is available on "
"all Unix versions."
msgstr "該模組提供對 Unix 群組資料庫的存取， 所有 Unix 版本皆可使用。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:12
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "可用性"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:14
msgid ""
"Group database entries are reported as a tuple-like object, whose attributes "
"correspond to the members of the ``group`` structure (Attribute field below, "
"see ``<grp.h>``):"
msgstr ""
"群組資料庫條目以類似 tuple 物件的方式報傳入， 其屬性對應於 ``group`` 結構的成"
"員（屬性欄位如下， 請參閱 ``<grp.h>``）："

#: ../../library/grp.rst:19
msgid "Index"
msgstr "索引"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:19
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "屬性"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:19
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含義"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:21
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:21
msgid "gr_name"
msgstr "gr_name"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:21
msgid "the name of the group"
msgstr "群組名稱"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:23
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:23
msgid "gr_passwd"
msgstr "gr_passwd"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:23
msgid "the (encrypted) group password; often empty"
msgstr "（被加密後的）群組密碼；大部分情況下是空的"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:26
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:26
msgid "gr_gid"
msgstr "gr_gid"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:26
msgid "the numerical group ID"
msgstr "群組的數字 ID"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:28
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:28
msgid "gr_mem"
msgstr "gr_mem"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:28
msgid "all the group member's  user names"
msgstr "所有群組成員的使用者名稱"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:32
msgid ""
"The gid is an integer, name and password are strings, and the member list is "
"a list of strings. (Note that most users are not explicitly listed as "
"members of the group they are in according to the password database.  Check "
"both databases to get complete membership information.  Also note that a "
"``gr_name`` that starts with a ``+`` or ``-`` is likely to be a YP/NIS "
"reference and may not be accessible via :func:`getgrnam` or :func:"
"`getgrgid`.)"
msgstr ""
"gid 是整數，name 和 password 是字串， 而 member list 是字串串列。（請注意， "
"根據密碼資料庫， 大多數使用者並未被明確列為其所在群組的成員。 請檢查這兩個資"
"料庫，以取得完整的成員資訊。 另外請注意，以 ``+`` 或 ``-`` 開頭的 "
"``gr_name`` 很可能是 YP/NIS 參照，可能無法透過 :func:`getgrnam` 或 :func:"
"`getgrgid` 取得）。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:39
msgid "It defines the following items:"
msgstr "它定義了以下項目："

#: ../../library/grp.rst:44
msgid ""
"Return the group database entry for the given numeric group ID. :exc:"
"`KeyError` is raised if the entry asked for cannot be found."
msgstr ""
"回傳給定群組 ID 的群組資料庫條目。 :exc:`KeyError` 會在找不到所要求的條目時被"
"引發。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:47
msgid ""
":exc:`TypeError` is raised for non-integer arguments like floats or strings."
msgstr ":exc:`TypeError` 會在非整數的引數如浮點數或字串被傳入時被引發。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:52
msgid ""
"Return the group database entry for the given group name. :exc:`KeyError` is "
"raised if the entry asked for cannot be found."
msgstr ""
"回傳給定群組名稱的群組資料庫條目。 :exc:`KeyError` 會在找不到所要求的條目時引"
"發。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:58
msgid "Return a list of all available group entries, in arbitrary order."
msgstr "以任意順序傳回所有可用群組條目的串列。"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:63
msgid "Module :mod:`pwd`"
msgstr ":mod:`pwd` 模組"

#: ../../library/grp.rst:64
msgid "An interface to the user database, similar to this."
msgstr "使用者資料庫的介面，與此類似。"
